<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Hex Spider is Spider, the game of patience played with two decks, for one player. Build each suit from the king down to the ace in the ten columns of the table: a whole suit in order goes to its place by itself. Put away all eight suits to win. Your score is your own, and your best games go into the ranking."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_keyboard}>{dgettext("help_games", "Controls")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Tap a card")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Move it, with the cards of its suit on top of it, onto the best column: one of the same suit first"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Drag")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Move a card, or the cards of its suit on top of it, onto another column"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Tap the deck")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Deal one card onto every column"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Tap the deck before you play")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Change the back of the cards"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_games", "Rules")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "On the table, a card goes on a card one higher in value, of any suit. Any card goes into an empty column."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Cards move together only when they follow each other in the same suit."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The deck deals only when no column is empty. A face-down card turns over by itself once nothing lies on it."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Hex Spider plays with one suit. Hex Spider: Two Suits mixes spades and hearts, and Hex Spider: Four Suits uses all four: harder, and closer to the classic game."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "When the deck is empty and no card can move any more, the game ends with the points you have."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_games", "Score")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "You start with 500 points. Every move, and every deal from the deck, costs 1 point; every whole suit put away earns 100."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The End button keeps the points you have. A game still open after an hour ends by itself."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "Inspiration")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Spider is a game of patience from the twentieth century, made famous on the PC by the version that came with Windows."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_games", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-hex-solitaire">{dgettext("help_games", "Hex Solitaire")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-hex-freecell">{dgettext("help_games", "Hex FreeCell")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-retro-games">{dgettext("help_games", "Retro Games")}</.help_link>
</p>
